   "name": "South Street Local Historic District",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The Historic District Commission approved a preliminary report prepared by Chris Skelly for submission to the Massachusetts Historical Commission and organized neighborhood outreach and public hearings [M01#1, M01#2, M02#1]. The Historical Commission voted to send a letter of support for the proposed district as it advanced to the Planning Board and City Council [M11#5]. After establishing the district, commissioners noted the requirement to file the district map with the Registrar of Deeds to finalize its official status [M24#2]. The commission subsequently conducted site visits to determine locations for permanent historic markers and partnered with local vocational high school students to design and fabricate signage for the district [M29#2, M31#3, M32#1].",
