  {
   "name": "Historical survey projects and inventory documentation",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The commission funded and conducted MHC Form B historical surveys and neighborhood area surveys across Medford, including the Brickyards, Fulton Heights, Bradley Hall Estates, Sagamore Vale, and Hastings Heights [M03#5, M10#6, M11#7, M16#8, M20#8, M22#6, M25#8]. It also voted to recommend Shiloh Baptist Church and Oak Grove Cemetery structures for National Register eligibility reviews, with Shiloh Baptist Church determined eligible [M09#3, M15#7]. Efforts were undertaken to modernize records by designing a searchable digital database and local history wiki using inventory forms [M27#8, M28#5, M30#7]. Additional documentation surveys were authorized for properties undergoing development, such as Medford High School and the Brooks Estate neighborhood [M35#6, M40#11, M40#13].",
